      "timestamp": "23:41",
      "text": "I was reading this amazing story yesterday."
    },
    {
      "sender": "...",
      "reply_delay": 0.6,
      "typing_duration": 2.2,
      "timestamp": "23:41",
      "text": "It had absolutely no context, yet it made sense."
    },
    {
      "sender": "you",
      "reply_delay": 1.4,
      "typing_duration": 1.1,
      "timestamp": "23:41",
      "text": "What do you mean?"
    },
    {
      "sender": "...",
      "reply_delay": 1.8,
      "typing_duration": 2.8,
      "timestamp": "23:42",
      "text": "The writer didn't care to explain who was talking to whom,"
    },
    {
      "sender": "...",
      "reply_delay": 0.5,
      "typing_duration": 1.4,
      "timestamp": "23:42",
      "text": "how were they related,"
    },
    {
      "sender": "...",
      "reply_delay": 0.6,
      "typing_duration": 1.3,
      "timestamp": "23:42",
      "text": "even their gendres!"
