    {
      "sender": "...",
      "reply_delay": 0.4,
      "typing_duration": 0.7,
      "timestamp": "23:42",
      "text": "*genders"
    },
    {
      "sender": "...",
      "reply_delay": 0.8,
      "typing_duration": 1.5,
      "timestamp": "23:42",
      "text": "And yet, it didn't matter."
    },
    {
      "sender": "you",
      "reply_delay": 2.2,
      "typing_duration": 2.0,
      "timestamp": "23:43",
      "text": "So what was special about the story?"
    },
    {
      "sender": "you",
      "reply_delay": 0.7,
      "typing_duration": 1.8,
      "timestamp": "23:43",
      "text": "The plot, the twist, the metaphor?"
    },
    {
      "sender": "...",
      "reply_delay": 2.6,
      "typing_duration": 0.8,
      "timestamp": "23:43",
      "text": "Nothing."
    },
    {
      "sender": "...",
      "reply_delay": 0.9,
      "typing_duration": 2.4,
      "timestamp": "23:43",
      "text": "It was just a conversation, like you and me,"
